detect.onnx and sr.onnx — WeChat QR detector and super-resolution nets

These two files are the ONNX form of the WeChat QRCode models that
OpenCV's wechat_qrcode module loads. The arbez authors did not train
them. The SDK vendors the bytes so a scan does not download them.


